OL,3,GNEWSAVictorian hospital wins best
OL,4,Abuilding award after university
OL,5,Arestoration
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe restoration of a Victorian hospital
OL,8,Fby a university in an "extraordinary
OL,9,Ftransformation" has been awarded
OL,10,FScotland's biggest architecture prize.
OL,12,FThe University of Edinburgh transformed
OL,13,Fthe city's Old Royal Infirmary into a
OL,14,F"radically collaborative space for
OL,15,Flearning and research" that has few, if
OL,16,Fany, parallels in recent UK
OL,17,Farchitecture.
OL,19,FThe NHS vacated the Category A-listed
OL,20,Fbuilding in 2003 and it was purchased
OL,21,Fby the university in 2015 to become the
OL,22,FEdinburgh Futures Institute.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
