OL,3,GNEWSAVictorian hospital wins best
OL,4,Abuilding award after university
OL,5,Arestoration
OL,6,
OL,7,FArchitects Bennetts Associates are
OL,8,Fcredited with saving the Scottish
OL,9,FBaronial structure from dereliction and
OL,10,Fhave now secured the prestigious Andrew
OL,11,FDoolan Best Building in Scotland Award.
